+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Permits lateral control with cruise disengaged under the existing vehicle and steering conditions. The strict 2022–24 torque-steering Ioniq 5 HDA2/CAMERA SCC=2 profile requires explicit independent lateral permission and valid, current vehicle RX; this permission does not start longitudinal control.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+Restart comma after changing this setting on that Ioniq 5 profile. Update host and Panda together; invalid or missing inputs can block steering during a drive.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+
