+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+Requests lateral activation alone or lateral activation with cruise standby. The strict 2022–24 torque-steering Ioniq 5 HDA2/CAMERA SCC=2 profile never grants longitudinal permission from this setting or an outgoing acceleration request.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+On that Ioniq 5 profile, use the physical SET−/RES+ button initially and after brake, CANCEL or MAIN input. Porter automatic SET and other vehicles’ existing engagement policies are separate.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
